# Full Maple Mono NF CN family (319MB, Nerd Font icons + CJK charset), kept
# outside static/ on purpose: static/ is copied whole into the production
# build, so anything raw in there would ship. This is source material only,
# to subset from. The site ships static/fonts/maple-mono-web/ instead; see
# app.css.
/fonts/
